{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"dyn-header","type":"text","x":0,"y":-320,"width":1900,"height":220,"text":"# 回归预测与动态回归\n\n从实时信息集进入，区分动态来源；先把输入路径与响应路径配对，再检查预测不确定性和因果边界。\n\n**连续阅读：** [[01_Math/06_时间序列分析/08_动态回归与干预|动态回归与干预：从实时信息到长期乘数与因果边界]]","color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-info","type":"group","x":-100,"y":0,"width":2100,"height":580,"label":"1 · 先固定预测条件","color":"6"},
		{"id":"group-model","type":"group","x":-100,"y":680,"width":2100,"height":610,"label":"2 · 动态放在哪里","color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-effect","type":"group","x":-100,"y":1390,"width":1050,"height":500,"label":"3 · 输入如何变成期限响应","color":"5"},
		{"id":"group-intervention","type":"group","x":1050,"y":1390,"width":950,"height":500,"label":"4 · 干预编码与因果边界","color":"1"},
		{"id":"group-validation","type":"group","x":-100,"y":1990,"width":2100,"height":570,"label":"5 · 规格、诊断与部署验收","color":"3"},
		{"id":"info-task","type":"text","x":0,"y":110,"width":360,"height":190,"text":"## [[预测任务定义|预测任务]]\n\n先固定 target、origin、horizon、输出形式与决策损失。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"info-set","type":"text","x":420,"y":110,"width":360,"height":190,"text":"## [[预测时点与信息集|实时信息集]]\n\n每个历史起点只能使用当时可见的数据版本与 predictor。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"info-exante","type":"text","x":840,"y":110,"width":400,"height":190,"text":"## [[事前与事后回归预测|事前与事后预测]]\n\n事前只用起点信息；事后可代入后来实现的 $x$，但不是原时点的 genuine forecast。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"info-path","type":"text","x":1300,"y":110,"width":500,"height":190,"text":"## [[预测变量路径与条件区间|预测变量路径与条件区间]]\n\n常见区间条件于输入的未来 $x$ 路径，不自动传播 $x$ 本身的预测不确定性。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"model-family","type":"text","x":0,"y":790,"width":360,"height":210,"text":"## [[动态回归模型|动态回归模型族]]\n\n一个结果 $y$，但动态可能来自 $x$ 滞后、$y$ 滞后或回归误差。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"model-regarima","type":"text","x":410,"y":790,"width":360,"height":210,"text":"## [[ARIMA误差回归|ARIMA 误差回归]]\n\n$\\eta_t$ 是回归偏离；只有 ARIMA innovation $\\varepsilon_t$ 应近似白噪声。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"model-dl","type":"text","x":820,"y":790,"width":360,"height":210,"text":"## [[分布滞后模型|分布滞后]]\n\n$C(B)x_t$ 用 transfer weights 表示输入直接到达各期限的形状。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"model-adl","type":"text","x":1230,"y":790,"width":360,"height":210,"text":"## [[自回归分布滞后|ADL / ARDL]]\n\n再加入滞后 $y$，让输入效应和初始条件继续传播。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"model-distinction","type":"text","x":1640,"y":790,"width":360,"height":210,"text":"## [[因变量滞后与ARIMA误差|滞后 $y$ 与 ARIMA 误差]]\n\n一个传播条件均值，一个传播未解释偏离；预测接近不等于参数含义相同。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"effect-dl","type":"text","x":0,"y":1520,"width":430,"height":220,"text":"## [[分布滞后乘数|分布滞后乘数]]\n\n单个权重是 pulse response；权重部分和是永久 step 的期限响应。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"effect-adl","type":"text","x":500,"y":1520,"width":350,"height":220,"text":"## [[ADL长期乘数|ADL 长期乘数]]\n\n稳定 ADL(1,1) 的长期 step multiplier 为 $(\\beta_0+\\beta_1)/(1-\\rho)$。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"intervention-types","type":"text","x":1150,"y":1520,"width":370,"height":220,"text":"## [[干预函数类型|脉冲、阶跃与斜坡]]\n\n先编码一次、永久或渐进的输入；动态模型再决定结果怎样传播。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"intervention-causal","type":"text","x":1590,"y":1520,"width":310,"height":220,"text":"## [[干预系数因果边界|干预因果边界]]\n\n显著与白噪声诊断不能代替可信反事实和时点外生性。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"valid-scale","type":"text","x":0,"y":2130,"width":350,"height":210,"text":"## [[协整与差分边界|先确定建模尺度]]\n\n水平含随机趋势时，先判断伪回归、差分或 ECM。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"valid-workflow","type":"text","x":410,"y":2130,"width":430,"height":210,"text":"## [[动态回归规格流程|动态回归规格流程]]\n\n按机制提出小型候选，保持共同样本，并完整重放部署。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"valid-resid","type":"text","x":900,"y":2130,"width":340,"height":210,"text":"## [[ARMA残差诊断|Innovation 诊断]]\n\n检查剩余相关、波动、尾部、异常点和结构变化。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"valid-rolling","type":"text","x":1300,"y":2130,"width":340,"height":210,"text":"## [[滚动起点评估|Rolling-origin 评估]]\n\n每个起点内重做 predictor forecast、预处理和选择。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"valid-target","type":"text","x":1700,"y":2130,"width":200,"height":210,"text":"## [[预测与因果目标|目标边界]]\n\n预测成功不识别干预效应。","color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"edge-01","fromNode":"info-task","fromSide":"right","toNode":"info-set","toSide":"left","label":"固定 origin、horizon 与用途"},
		{"id":"edge-02","fromNode":"info-set","fromSide":"right","toNode":"info-exante","toSide":"left","label":"限定是否真实可执行"},
		{"id":"edge-03","fromNode":"info-exante","fromSide":"right","toNode":"info-path","toSide":"left","label":"未知 x 需预测或设情景"},
		{"id":"edge-04","fromNode":"model-family","fromSide":"right","toNode":"model-regarima","toSide":"left","label":"动态放在误差"},
		{"id":"edge-05","fromNode":"model-family","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"model-dl","toSide":"left","label":"动态放在 x 的滞后"},
		{"id":"edge-06","fromNode":"model-dl","fromSide":"right","toNode":"model-adl","toSide":"left","label":"再加入 y 的滞后"},
		{"id":"edge-07","fromNode":"model-regarima","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"model-distinction","toSide":"top","label":"比较误差持续"},
		{"id":"edge-08","fromNode":"model-adl","fromSide":"right","toNode":"model-distinction","toSide":"left","label":"比较均值传播"},
		{"id":"edge-09","fromNode":"model-dl","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"effect-dl","toSide":"top","label":"给定 pulse 或 step"},
		{"id":"edge-10","fromNode":"model-adl","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"effect-adl","toSide":"top","label":"稳定后汇总传播"},
		{"id":"edge-11","fromNode":"intervention-types","fromSide":"left","toNode":"effect-dl","toSide":"right","label":"输入形状决定响应求和"},
		{"id":"edge-12","fromNode":"intervention-types","fromSide":"right","toNode":"intervention-causal","toSide":"left","label":"编码不等于识别"},
		{"id":"edge-13","fromNode":"info-path","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"valid-workflow","toSide":"top","label":"记录未来输入条件"},
		{"id":"edge-14","fromNode":"model-distinction","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"valid-workflow","toSide":"top","label":"避免重复动态"},
		{"id":"edge-15","fromNode":"effect-adl","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"valid-workflow","toSide":"top","label":"检查稳定根与乘数"},
		{"id":"edge-16","fromNode":"valid-scale","fromSide":"right","toNode":"valid-workflow","toSide":"left","label":"先决定水平、差分或 ECM"},
		{"id":"edge-17","fromNode":"valid-workflow","fromSide":"right","toNode":"valid-resid","toSide":"left","label":"诊断 innovation"},
		{"id":"edge-18","fromNode":"valid-resid","fromSide":"right","toNode":"valid-rolling","toSide":"left","label":"合格后检验未来表现"},
		{"id":"edge-19","fromNode":"intervention-causal","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"valid-target","toSide":"top","label":"需要额外反事实依据"},
		{"id":"edge-20","fromNode":"valid-rolling","fromSide":"right","toNode":"valid-target","toSide":"left","label":"预测证据不越界"}
	]
}